  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of Vessel Monitoring System in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ODA Capacity uplift - Funding provided to IOM to install vessel monitoring system transponder units on Sri Lanka&apos;s fleet of multi-day fishing vessels and establish a land based VMS monitoring platform for the Sri Lankan Department of Fisheries and Aquatic Resourceswhich will significantly enhance Sri Lanka&#x2019;s capacity to monitor the movements of its commercial fishing fleet.  By enhancing maritime domain awareness, the project bolsters Sri Lanka&#x2019;s capacity to combat people smuggling and other transnational crime, including IUU fishing in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
